  "title": "Indus Valley is ours",
  "briefing": "Ironwood Trust holds Indus Valley through its switching yard. Reconnect 3 relays, take down the site warden, hold the uplink while it broadcasts, unlock the service gate, then leave by the exit. Expect 9 enemy agents and 4 guards on the streets.",
  "story": "Indus Valley Blackout: Ironwood Trust runs Indus Valley from its switching yard, and the district only notices when the lights go out. Your team has one night to reconnect the relays, silence the warden, hold the uplink and walk out the exit.",
  "debrief": {
    "success": "Indus Valley wakes up with the switching yard in other hands. Your team is back in the dark before morning.",
    "failure": "The team is down in Indus Valley before the work was done. Regroup and try a different approach."
  },
